dth=8) overflow scenario is untouched. All new hardware logic is inside `if (P4MEnable)` / `p4m_q` gates so the P4MEnable=0 path is unchanged. No contract/Linux/IOMMU files are touched. Nothing was compiled or executed here; the edits are exact-text proposals for the parent to apply and run.",
